  m_text: Drive alternates paddle strokes; steer carves and leans. ACTION performs
    a brace/roll and rights an inverted kayak. Follow slalom gates through real currents,
    boulders, eddies and waterfalls. Keep the hull level at landing; rotation followed
    by a controlled landing scores freestyle. Capsizes cost20. In Survival, stay
    afloat and progress downriver. AI uses the same strokes and roll recovery.
